           <div type="translation" xml:lang="fra" source="bib:Coedes1953_01">
 	<p rend="stanza" n="1">The good woman (satī) who was the daughter (duhitā) of the Guru of the king (bhūbhṛdguroḥ), wife of the son (°sūnujāyā) of Śrīkavīndusūrīśvara, the mother (mātā) of the prince (kumārasya), Madopasomā [by name], gave (adāt) [this] bull (ṛṣabham) with joy (mudā) to [Śiva,] the bearer of the crescent moon (somārdhadhāriṇi).</p>
         </div>  
